  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi></math> be three non-zero real numbers such that the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>a</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;has two distinct real roots <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>. Then, the value of <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "0.5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>From equations&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
